WebRTC (Web Real-Time Communication) is an open-source technology that allows browsers and mobile applications to communicate with each other in real time without requiring additional plugins.

It enables:

Audio calls 🎤
Video calls 📹
Live chat 💬
Screen sharing 🖥️
File sharing 📁
Multiplayer gaming 🎮

In simple terms:

WebRTC allows two devices or browsers to communicate directly with each other in real time.